  "description": "Always on the go and ready to race? Then our HYBE CF 9 with its carbon frame is your perfect match! This eFully will reliably take you through any terrain to the finish line – with plenty of power and flow. With 170mm of front travel, 160mm at the back and a mullet setup featuring mixed wheel sizes, you’ll get optimal downhill performance and perfect uphill traction. The powerful Bosch Performance CX Smart System motor provides strong acceleration uphill, while the 800Wh battery guarantees maximum range for all your trail adventures. Big jumps, tricky root sections and technical rock gardens – this eMountain bike handles them with ease! The perfect bike for all your adventures – whether in touring or racing mode.!",
